All 13 submitted claims reconstructed to `#Top`, and the false-result mutation correctly failed. However, the proof covers only five concrete examples and synthetic inputs of length at most three. The `tokenText` split abstraction has no valid bridge to real strings, with a preserved concrete counterexample.

